  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Slice capsicum into strips. Trim green beans and slice into thirds.\n• Finely crush or chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de89c39f43e63b992b4ba2/step-58534cb7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place udon noodles in a medium heatproof bowl.\n• Add enough boiling water to cover the noodles. Set aside, separating occasionally with a fork, until tender, 2-3 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de89c39f43e63b992b4ba2/step-e81530a8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, melt the butter with a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Stir-fry carrot, capsicum, green beans and a splash of water until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Stir in Bengal curry paste (see ingredients), coconut milk, brown sugar, soy sauce and the water. Cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de89c39f43e63b992b4ba2/step-669ad5e5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cooked noodles to the veggie curry and toss to coat.\n• Divide the mild coconut curry noodles between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with roasted peanuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de89c39f43e63b992b4ba2/step-36fb6448.jpg"
    }
  ]
